---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { pages } from '../data/pages';
import { graph, webPageNode, articleNode, abs, ids } from '../lib/schema';
import { focusStyle } from '../lib/focus';

import kurungImg from '../assets/images/portraits/dr-kartini-farah-rahim-baju-kurung-stethoscope.jpg';
import wrapImg from '../assets/images/clinical/childrens-skin-care-dr-kartini.jpg';
import dogImg from '../assets/images/animal-welfare/dr-kartini-with-rescued-dog.jpg';
import gasingImg from '../assets/images/environment/save-bukit-gasing-community-advocacy.jpg';

const meta = pages.story;
const url = abs(meta.path);
const schema = graph([
  webPageNode({ url, type: 'AboutPage', name: meta.title, description: meta.description, imageUrl: abs('/og/page/story.jpg'), about: { '@id': ids.person }, speakable: ['.story-intro'] }),
  articleNode({
    url,
    headline: 'Beyond Skin: The Story of Dr Kartini Farah Rahim',
    description: meta.description,
    imageUrl: abs('/og/page/story.jpg'),
    datePublished: '2026-09-14T00:00:00+08:00',
    dateModified: '2026-09-14T00:00:00+08:00',
    keywords: ['Dr Kartini story', 'Malaysian dermatologist', 'animal welfare', 'PEKA', 'Raden Adjeng Kartini'],
    section: 'Profile',
    inLanguage: 'en-MY',
    wordCount: 700,
    medical: false,
    citations: [],
    about: [{ '@id': ids.person }],
  }),
]);
---
<BaseLayout
  title={meta.title}
  description={meta.description}
  path={meta.path}
  ogImage="/og/page/story.jpg"
  ogType="article"
  schema={schema}
  crumbs={[{ name: 'Home', path: '/' }, { name: 'About', path: '/about-dr-kartini/' }, { name: 'Her story', path: meta.path }]}
  article={{ publishedTime: '2026-09-14T00:00:00+08:00', section: 'Profile' }}
>
  <article>
    <header class="page-hero">
      <div class="container split split--center">
        <div>
          <h1>Beyond Skin: The Story of Dr Kartini</h1>
          <p class="lead story-intro">
            How a dermatologist trained in Dublin, Scotland and Kuala Lumpur came to spend her free time rescuing animals and campaigning on plastic waste.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="photo photo--portrait hero-photo">
          <Image src={kurungImg} alt="Dr Kartini Farah Rahim in a blue baju kurung with a stethoscope" widths={[420, 805]} width={805} sizes="(min-width: 900px) 400px, 90vw" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="section">
      <div class="container--narrow prose">
        <h2>Her name</h2>
        <p>
          Kartini’s grandmother named her after Raden Adjeng Kartini, the Indonesian heroine remembered for her campaign for women’s education. She was born in
          Petaling Jaya, the eldest of four children, and studied medicine at University College Dublin before training in the United Kingdom.
        </p>

        <h2>Training in the UK and Malaysia</h2>
        <p>
          She started in dermatology in 2004 as a research fellow in Dundee, Scotland. She gained the Diploma in Dermatology from the Royal College of Physicians
          and Surgeons of Glasgow in 2005 and MRCP (UK) in 2007.
        </p>
        <p>
          In Malaysia she worked at Hospital Kuala Lumpur and Hospital Serdang, completed an Advanced Master of Dermatology at Universiti Kebangsaan Malaysia, and
          taught medicine and dermatology at Universiti Putra Malaysia for more than ten years. She now sees patients at the two Avisena hospitals in Shah Alam.
        </p>

        <h2>Explaining skin conditions</h2>
        <blockquote>
          <p>“I always see myself as a teacher. Sometimes the same information needs to be repeated every time an issue comes up.”</p>
        </blockquote>
        <p class="small muted">Translated from an interview with Harian Metro, 16 May 2019.</p>
        <p>
          Eczema, psoriasis, hidradenitis suppurativa and ichthyosis are visible, often long-term, and widely misunderstood. From 2015 Dr Kartini became involved
          with patient support groups, awareness campaigns and health columns, and she chaired National Skin Day from 2015 to 2017. She still explains skin care
          on television and in print.
        </p>
        <figure>
          <Image src={wrapImg} alt="Dr Kartini applying wet wraps to a young child with eczema" widths={[480, 870]} width={870} sizes="(min-width: 820px) 480px, 90vw" class="story-portrait" style={focusStyle(wrapImg)} />
          <figcaption>Wet wrap treatment for a young child with eczema. The child’s face has been blurred.</figcaption>
        </figure>

        <h2>Rescuing animals</h2>
        <p>
          Dr Kartini rescues cats and dogs, and calls herself “Mummy Cat-Tini”. In August 2025 she picked up a lost kitten, Mochi, from a busy road in Shah Alam. She is a board member of Filbert’s Foundation for Furry Friends and argues for neutering, vaccination and rehoming as the long-term way to
          reduce stray numbers.
        </p>

        <h2>Environmental work</h2>
        <p>
          As Vice-President of Pertubuhan Pelindung Khazanah Alam Malaysia (PEKA), she writes and speaks about single-use plastics, recycling and the protection of
          urban forests such as Bukit Gasing. She brings her own food containers to the clinic.
        </p>
        <div class="duo">
          <figure>
            <Image src={dogImg} alt="Dr Kartini crouching with a rescued dog" widths={[400, 768]} width={768} sizes="(min-width: 820px) 370px, 45vw" />
          </figure>
          <figure>
            <Image src={gasingImg} alt="Community members calling for the protection of Bukit Gasing forest in Petaling Jaya" widths={[400, 800]} width={800} sizes="(min-width: 820px) 370px, 45vw" />
          </figure>
        </div>

        <h2>Why it fits together</h2>
        <p>
          Dr Kartini sees no contradiction between her clinical work and her volunteering. In her words, how people treat animals and the environment says a lot
          about a society. Both come from the same habit of looking after others.
        </p>

        <p class="next">
          Continue reading: <a href="/about-dr-kartini/">full profile</a>, <a href="/animal-welfare/">animal welfare</a>, <a href="/community/environment/">environment</a>,
          <a href="/media/">media</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .hero-photo {
    max-width: 400px;
    width: 100%;
    justify-self: center;
  }
  figure {
    margin: 1.75rem 0;
  }
  figure :global(img) {
    margin: 0;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
  }
  figure :global(.story-portrait) {
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 3 / 2;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center 35%;
  }
  .duo {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin: 1.75rem 0;
  }
  .duo figure {
    margin: 0;
  }
  .duo :global(img) {
    aspect-ratio: 4 / 5;
    object-fit: cover;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
  }
  .next {
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    padding-top: 1.25rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
</style>
